contentText:
Ariana Grande is weeding people&#8217;s criticisms out of her life &#8212; literally. In the music video for &#8220;Petal,&#8221; the title track of her new album that dropped on Friday (July 31), the Wicked actress reclaims her narrative by taking a garden chainsaw to a group of executives who have a little too much to say about her.

